---This account's site shares (`/apikey/share`), newest first: `status` is `PENDING` (waiting for the account holder's approval), `ACTIVE` (approved, link not used), `CLAIMED` (the other person connected), `REVOKED` or `EXPIRED`. For an `ACTIVE` share, keys with full access or the `account` permission also get `shareUrl`, `qrCodeUrl`, `shareCode` and `handoffPrompt` to pass on; other keys see the share without them. A domain-limited key sees only its domains' shares. Also available via GET.
