---Mint WordPress REST API credentials (WordPress only)
---
---**To edit a site's content from an agent, use `/hosting/wpRequest` and `/hosting/wpUploadMedia` instead: they run inside the site and need no password.** This endpoint is for code that calls the WordPress REST API itself.
